# Line endings, pinned so they stop depending on who checks the repository out.
#
# Everything textual is stored as LF, in the working tree as well, which is what the
# project's own files already use. Without this, a clone on Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# rewrites every file to CRLF and the next commit becomes a whole-repository diff.
#
# `text=auto` leaves anything git detects as binary alone; the patterns below make that
# explicit for the types this project is likely to gain.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
